80	\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_1:ReactionPlane}
81	\lean{IPhO2026.Problem1.C1.ReactionPlane}
82	The plane containing the incident photon and the outgoing fragments of
83	Figure~1c, modelled as an abstract two-dimensional real Euclidean space so
