90	\begin{definition}[Incident photon line]
91	\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_1:PhotonLine}
92	\lean{IPhO2026.Problem1.C1.PhotonLine}
93	\uses{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_1:ReactionPlane}
94	The direction of the incident photon (and of its momentum) in the reaction
95	plane: a vector $\hat{k}$ certified to be a unit vector,
